        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know how you actually keep your balance on a bike? Most people don’t. You do it with small, deliberate, but unconscious steering movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So prepare to learn how to ride a bike again, only this time doing it consciously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for the most relaxing experience of your life, as this small calm (absolutely not enraging in any way) cycling game is featuring:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 frame, 1 fork, 2 wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0 training wheels, no fall protection or automatic balance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a realistic simulation of bike physics and movement </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 custom map to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >around 15 minutes to many hours of playtime, if you're stubborn enough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >save and load game functionality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >relaxing music</p></li></ul>",
